      "content": "i dont even know why im typing this but im just so tired. like actually tired deep in my bones. i feel like i've been running a race for years that i was never meant to win and now i'm just... stuck. everything i do feels pointless and i feel like i'm just letting everyone down constantly. it feels like there's no way out of this loop.",
